OL,3,APrince William joins royals and
OL,4,Adiplomats in Oslo to pay final tribute
OL,5,Ato late King Harald V
OL,6,
OL,7,FEuropean royals and diplomats are
OL,8,Fgathering in Oslo for the funeral of
OL,9,FKing Harald V
OL,11,FThe late king of Norway died in August
OL,12,Fafter 35 years on the throne. His son,
OL,13,FHaakon VIII, has since succeeded him
OL,15,FThe Prince of Wales will be
OL,16,Frepresenting King Charles while
OL,17,FPrincess Anne, who is godmother to the
OL,18,Fnew Norwegian king, is attending in a
OL,19,Fprivate capacity
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
