OL,3,APrince William joins royals and
OL,4,Adiplomats in Oslo to pay final tribute
OL,5,Ato late King Harald V
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King and Queen of Denmark as well
OL,8,Fas the King and Queen of Sweden are
OL,9,Falso set to attend as large crowds are
OL,10,Fexpected in Oslo for the farewell
OL,12,FThe service will be held at Oslo
OL,13,FCathedral from 11:00 BST following a
OL,14,Ffuneral procession from the Royal
OL,15,FPalace. He will then be laid to rest at
OL,16,FAkershus Fortress
OL,18,FYou can follow live coverage by
OL,19,Fclicking watch live above
